                <mxCell id="ctx_title" value="Baglam buyumesi - her istek tum gecmisi yeniden gonderir" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="910" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ctx1" value="Sabit her istekte: instructions (~0.5k) + tool tanimlari (~2.4k) = ~2.9k token&#xa;Degisken: kullanici mesajlari + reasoning + tool sonuclari, kumulatif&#xa;k. adimda eklenen bir kalem (N-k+1) kez daha gonderilir - toplam ucgensel, anlik doluluk lineer&#xa;Pencere: num_ctx=16384 (bildirimli, devralinan degil)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="950" width="760" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ctx2" value="Prefix KV cache&#xa;Ollama en uzun ortak prefix&#39;i yeniden kullanir, sadece yeni suffix prefill edilir.&#xa;Kosul: token 0&#39;dan itibaren byte-ozdes prefix. instructions degisirse (ornek: dosya eklendi)&#xa;o noktadan sonrasi bastan prefill olur.&#xa;keep_alive=10m - runner bosalirsa KV cache de gider." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="820" y="950" width="750" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="p3" name="3 - Kapisiz koseler">
        <mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1100" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="k_title" value="Su an kapisi olmayan noktalar - hangisi kimin tarafinda" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k_g1" value="Zaman - hepsi bizim tarafta" style="rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="75" width="760" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k1" value="&lt;b&gt;totalMs = 120s, tek kapi&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Tum turu kapsiyor: her model cagrisi + her tool + tum dusunme.&#xa;Duz sayi verildigi icin stepMs / firstChunkMs / chunkMs / toolMs hepsi undefined.&#xa;Yasayan ama yavas model oluyor, gercekten kilitlenen ayni surede yakalaniyor." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="55" y="110" width="730" height="90" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k2" value="&lt;b&gt;Tool calistirmada timeout yok&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;toolMs kurulmuyor. Asilmis bir MCP reader child process sonsuza kadar bekler,&#xa;yalnizca 120s total kapisi onu keser - o da tum turu oldurerek." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="55" y="210" width="730" height="75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k3" value="&lt;b&gt;Istemci kopmasi dongüye yayilmiyor&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;streamText&#39;e abortSignal gecmiyoruz. Kullanici sekmeyi kapatinca adim dongusu,&#xa;model cagrisi ve MCP callTool calismaya devam eder." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="55" y="295" width="730" height="75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k_g2" value="Dongu ve butce" style="rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#d79b00;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="820" y="75" width="760" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k4" value="&lt;b&gt;Otomatik yeniden gondermeye tavan yok&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;sendAutomaticallyWhen her stream sonunda degerlendiriliyor. Part ilerlemezse&#xa;istemci sonsuz POST atar. Ayni approval.id icin deneme sayaci yok." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="835" y="110" width="730" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k5" value="&lt;b&gt;isStepCount(8) istek basina&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Onay turu ikiye boldugu icin sayac ikinci istekte sifirlanir. Tur basina&#xa;toplam adim veya tool cagrisi butcesi yok." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="835" y="200" width="730" height="75" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k6" value="&lt;b&gt;Baglam butcesi olcumu yok&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Tool sonucu messages&#39;a girmeden once token maliyeti kontrol edilmiyor.&#xa;Sema tavanlari (READ_SHEET_MAX_CELLS vb.) tek savunma; kumulatif toplam olculmuyor.&#xa;16384 asilirsa ne oldugu hic gozlenmedi." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="835" y="285" width="730" height="90" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k_g3" value="Gorunurluk" style="rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="425" width="760" height="270" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k7" value="&lt;b&gt;reasoning part&#39;i cizilmiyor&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Olay geliyor, istemci yok sayiyor. Model dusunurken UI bos.&#xa;Timeout hissinin dogrudan kaynagi." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="55" y="460" width="730" height="70" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k8" value="&lt;b&gt;Adim gorunurlugu yok&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;start-step / finish-step geliyor ama UI kaci kacinci adimda oldugunu gostermiyor.&#xa;Kullanici 8 adimlik bir zincirin neresinde oldugunu bilmiyor." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="55" y="540" width="730" height="70" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k9" value="&lt;b&gt;Adim maliyeti olculmuyor&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;usage adim basina geliyor, hicbir yere yazilmiyor. prompt_eval_count ile&#xa;cache isabetini dogrulayabilirdik, log yok." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="55" y="620" width="730" height="65" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k_g4" value="Hic kosulmamis yollar" style="rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#808080;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="820" y="425" width="760" height="270" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k10" value="Gercek qwen3.8&#39;e karsi bastan sona basarili tek bir tur - hic olmadi&#xa;Reddet yolu -&gt; output-denied, model tool&#39;u tekrar denemeden cevapliyor mu&#xa;describe -&gt; read -&gt; anlat zinciri adim butcesine siginiyor mu&#xa;TTL sohbetin ortasinda dolunca file_not_found duzgun mu&#xa;Ikinci session ilk session&#39;in dosyasini isteyince sandbox gercekten reddediyor mu&#xa;Reader child process cokerse ne oluyor - yeniden spawn yok&#xa;MCP_MAX_SESSIONS tavani dolunca evictOverflow davranisi" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="835" y="460" width="730" height="170" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k_g5" value="Ollama tarafi - bizim kapimiz yok, olmasi da gerekmiyor" style="rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="715" width="1540" height="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="k11" value="Ollama koşan bir generation&#39;i sureyle KESMIYOR. Gordugumuz TimeoutError DOMException&#39;i&#xa;bizim AbortSignal.timeout kaynakli - Ollama boyle bir sey uretmiyor.&#xa;&#xa;Ollama&#39;nin kendi kapilari: OLLAMA_LOAD_TIMEOUT (sadece model yukleme), istek kuyrugu,&#xa;OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL (es zamanli slot), OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH, OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE.&#xa;&#xa;Paylasilan host riski: runner num_ctx&#39;e gore anahtarlanir. Bizim 16384 host&#39;ta yuklu olandan&#xa;farkliysa ayni agirliklar icin ikinci runner acilir - VRAM iki kat." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="55" y="750" width="1510" height="130" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>